{%- comment -%}
  TEMPORARY PREVIEW HARNESS — delete after the hero ships.
  Renders sections/lbass-hero.liquid on its own so the new hero can be reviewed
  without touching templates/index.liquid (226KB, not round-trippable via the
  Admin API). Reach it by appending ?view=herotest to ANY page URL, e.g.
      /pages/shipping-and-payment?view=herotest
  No Shopify page object is created, so nothing is added to the live store.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% section 'lbass-hero' %}
<div class="wrap" style="padding:40px 24px">
  <p style="font-family:var(--lb-arabic);font-weight:800">↑ preview harness for sections/lbass-hero.liquid</p>
</div>
